"the providers available from the app, parent mount, route and component"}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If a route depends on a service that is not provided, or if a routed component expects an input that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the route does not supply, "},{"t":"code","text":"_CanRunApp"},{"t":"text","text":" turns that mismatch into a TypeScript error in the routes file."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Typical errors look like:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"The Counter service is not provided in path: \"some-path\""}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"Input \"userId\" is not provided in path: \"some-path\""}]}]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"_2-define-routes-with-craftroute-and-collect-them-with-craftroutes","children":[{"t":"text","text":"2. Define routes with "},{"t":"code","text":"craftRoute"},{"t":"text","text":" and collect them with "},{"t":"code","text":"craftRoutes"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Collect routes with "},{"t":"code","text":"craftRoutes(...)"},{"t":"text","text":". For Craft components, spread"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"loadCraftComponent(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" into the route: the helper carries the component's dependency contract"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"into the route type, so you do not repeat it as "},{"t":"code","text":"componentDeps"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"Breaking rename","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The former "},{"t":"code","text":"route(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" helper has been renamed to "},{"t":"code","text":"craftRoute(...)"},{"t":"text","text":". There is no compatibility alias:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"update both the import and every call site."}]}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"